# LLASO Warehouse v1 - truck cargo receiver: 4 dock bays, inspection strip, cold + fragile storage, CTB/Rack Packing link
# Same coordinate system as LLASO_Facility.obj: origin = centre of the hall end-face at floor level, 1 unit = 1 m.
# Warehouse extends toward -Z (away from the facility). +X side = CTB / Rack Packing. -X side = Fragile + Cold storage.
# MIRRORED variant (X negated, winding flipped) - use with LLASO_Facility_MIRRORED.obj
